      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اهمج</span></b> , (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِهْمَاجٌ</span>, TA,) <i>He</i> (a horse, S,
K, or other animal that runs, Lh,) <i>strove</i> or
<i>exerted himself, in his running,</i> (S, K,) <i>and then
ran impetuously, so as to raise the dust.</i> (TA.)

